            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003ESite health checks and audits\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEvery website has opportunities to improve performance, but also to make tweaks and adjustments that prevent issues from occurring before they happen.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOur website health checks and audits provide a thorough investigation of your site. We look at your coding, performance issues, areas of compliance, security aspects, even issues with content and more.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EDoes your site need a health check?\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOur site health checks and audits bring together over two decades of collective technical knowledge. We\u0027ve even made our site audit a standard step in our onboarding process for new clients.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPerformance can make all the difference in visitor numbers, lead generation and sales. Security, data privacy and compliance are also areas that constantly keep web teams on their toes.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA site health check comes at a set price, so your costs are predictable. We\u0027ll also sign an NDA to guarantee confidentiality.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
